  "conclusion": "Standard split is perfect (AUC=1.0) but LOSO fails: the model memorizes scenario-specific indicators and does not transfer to unseen attack styles. Even the best per-LOSO threshold cannot recover detection, and ransomware_like ranks inverted (AUC<0.5). benign_high_entropy FPR is 0.0 on the standard split, so no FP problem there \u2014 the problem is false negatives on novel attacks."
